{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05251","headline":"奉和幸新丰温泉宫应制 · 武平一","name":"奉和幸新丰温泉宫应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦王登碣石，周后袭崑仑。\n何必在遐远，方称万宇尊。\n我皇顺时豫，星驾动轩辕。\n雄戟交驰道，清笳度国门。\n回舆长乐观，校猎上林园。\n行漏移三象，连营总八屯。\n旌摇鹦鹉谷，骑转凤皇原。\n绝壁苍苔古，灵泉碧溜温。\n参差开水殿，䆗窱敞岩轩。\n丰邑模犹在，骊宫迹尚存。\n烟松衔翠幄，雪径遶花源。\n侍从推玄草，文章召虎贲。\n深仁浃夷夏，洪造溢乾坤。\n谬忝王枚列，多慙雨露恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武平一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}